*DevOps & DevSecOps:

 
DevOps vs DevSecOps 🚀🔐

DevOps is a set of practices and tools that unifies development and operations to enable faster, automated, and reliable software delivery across the CI/CD pipeline.

DevSecOps extends DevOps by embedding security at every stage of the SDLC — from design and code to build, test, deploy, and monitor — using automated security controls and continuous validation.

👉 DevOps = Speed + Collaboration
👉 DevSecOps = Speed + Collaboration + Security
